WEBVTT

00:02:29.061 --> 00:02:31.522
because we cannot
play a part in making change

00:02:31.522 --> 00:02:33.858
if we do not believe
that change is possible.

00:02:34.775 --> 00:02:35.818
Climate denialism,

00:02:35.818 --> 00:02:39.906
which for decades has been peddled by oil,
gas and other big business interests,

00:02:39.906 --> 00:02:41.574
has met its rival:

00:02:41.574 --> 00:02:42.742
climate doomism.

00:02:42.992 --> 00:02:44.994
The belief that we cannot save our planet,

00:02:44.994 --> 00:02:46.287
so why take action?

00:02:46.954 --> 00:02:48.372
Though they differ in origin,

00:02:48.372 --> 00:02:51.876
both have the ability to paralyze action
and prevent progress.

00:02:52.376 --> 00:02:53.961
And though things are bad,

00:02:53.961 --> 00:02:55.171
they’re far from over.

00:02:55.671 --> 00:02:58.090
So how do we find hope
when things feel hopeless,

00:02:58.090 --> 00:02:59.300
and how do we communicate

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:02.053
the inextricable link
between hope and action?